description:
ERECTION OF A SINGLE-STOREY SIDE AND PART REAR EXTENSION;
REPLACEMENT WINDOWS THROUGHOUT; INTERNAL REMODELLING; CONSTRUCTION OF WALL
ALONG BOUNDARY WITH PUBLIC PAVEMENT AND INSTALLATION OF NEW SIDE GATE;
INSTALLATION OF AIR SOURCE HEAT PUMPS WITHIN AN ENCLOSED COMPOUND; INSTALLATION
OF ROOF-MOUNTED SOLAR PHOTOVOLTAIC (PV) PANELS; INSTALLATION OF MECHANICAL
VENTILATION WITH HEAT RECOVERY (MVHR) SYSTEM; DEMOLITION OF OUTBUILDINGS;
THERMAL UPGRADING OF THE EXISTING DWELLING; AND ASSOCIATED LANDSCAPING AND
EXTERNAL WORKS.
